},"Two main benefits for college students joining the military: up to 20,000 RMB per year for tuition, two-year extension of student status, and a special postgraduate admission program"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-05"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["05"]},"Only six scenarios allow the government to assign jobs after discharge; those opting for self-employment must register within 30 days"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-06"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["06"]},"Three key financial aspects after discharge: one-time separation pay, military service counting toward work seniority, and tax deductions for self-employed veterans"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-07"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["07"]},"There’s more than just civil service exams to get into the government system: serving two years in grassroots programs qualifies you for a special recruitment quota of 10% each year"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-08"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["08"]},"Teachers in the Special Post Program who complete three years of service, pass evaluations, and wish to stay should be promptly added to the official teaching staff"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-09"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["09"]},"Firefighters and civilian personnel in the military represent two additional pathways for public recruitment, with lower entry requirements than civil service exams"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-10"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["10"]},"Education is not a one-time deal: self-study exams have no age or prior education limits; both adult college entrance exams and open universities offer pathways to further education"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-11"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["11"]},"Not joining a company means you must arrange your own social insurance: you’ll need to enroll in pension and medical plans at your place of work, as household registration restrictions have now been lifted"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-12"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["12"]},"Food delivery workers, ride‑hailing drivers, and local freight carriers all get occupational injury coverage paid for by the platform on a per‑order basis — at no cost to them"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-13"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["13"]},"Two pathways to secure a government job on the day you fill out college applications: government-funded teacher training and targeted medical student programs, at the cost of a six-year service commitment"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-14"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["14"]},"Before going abroad to work, check whether the company has a license for international labor cooperation: it is illegal for them to demand a deposit from you"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-15"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["15"]},"Working remotely for a foreign company from home: this income is considered domestic earnings for tax purposes; you must file your own individual income tax returns, and incoming payments should be reported as “employee compensation”"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/tip/31-16"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["16"]},"Starting a business without joining a company? First look at startup guarantee loans: up to 300,000 RMB per individual, with the government covering half the interest"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-tip-page"},"children":[{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-breadcrumb","aria-label":"Breadcrumb"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book"},"children":["Explore the book"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"aria-hidden":"true"},"children":["/"]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"/en/book/31"},"children":["Chapter 31"," ·"," ","What options are available after turning 18?"]}]},{"tag":"article","props":{"className":"life-entry-card status-unmarked is-standalone","id":"31-02"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-top"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-entry-number"},"children":["02"]},{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-evidence grade-a"},"children":["Evidence"," ","A"]}]},{"tag":"h1","props":{"lang":"en"},"children":["Men who turn 18 must complete military service registration by October 31; mandatory active duty lasts two years"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"lang":"en","className":"life-entry-summary"},"children":["Military service registration is a legal obligation, not an application to join the army. Completing it does not mean you must enlist. All men who turn 18 must register online by October 31. Failure to do so can result in a government order to register within a set period; if ignored, you may be forced into service and fined. Once enlisted, you serve as a conscript for exactly two years."]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-impact"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no cost. The online registration takes just a few…"]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The rules governing military service registration state: “By October 31 each year, local civil affairs bureaus…"]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-actions","aria-label":"Mark: Men who turn 18 must complete military service registration by October 31; mandatory active duty lasts two years"},"children":[{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action done","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-check","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M20 6 9 17l-5-5"},"children":[]}]},"Done"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action todo","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-list-todo","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"rect","props":{"x":"3","y":"5","width":"6","height":"6","rx":"1"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m3 17 2 2 4-4"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 6h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 12h8"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M13 18h8"},"children":[]}]},"Plan to do"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-action favorite","aria-pressed":"false"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-bookmark","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m19 21-7-4-7 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h10a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v16z"},"children":[]}]},"Save"]}," ",{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"social-share-trigger"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-share2 lucide-share-2","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"5","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"6","cy":"12","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"18","cy":"19","r":"3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"8.59","x2":"15.42","y1":"13.51","y2":"17.49"},"children":[]},{"tag":"line","props":{"x1":"15.41","x2":"8.59","y1":"6.51","y2":"10.49"},"children":[]}]},"Share this tip"]}]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button","className":"life-detail-toggle","aria-expanded":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"10","height":"10","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"currentColor","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-circle","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"circle","props":{"cx":"12","cy":"12","r":"10"},"children":[]}]},"Hide details"]},{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-chevron-down rotated","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"m6 9 6 6 6-6"},"children":[]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-entry-details"},"children":[{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Cost"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["There is no cost. The online registration takes just a few minutes. However, actual enlistment means two full years of service, during which you cannot hold any other job."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Benefit"]},{"tag":"p","props":{},"children":["The rules governing military service registration state: “By October 31 each year, local civil affairs bureaus must organize initial registration for all male citizens who will turn 18 by December 31.” They also specify that registration is primarily done online, at the citizen’s own initiative. Consequences of non‑compliance are outlined in Article 57, Paragraph 1 of the Military Service Law, which addresses “refusal or evasion of registration.” Penalties include a deadline set by the county government for compliance, followed by forced enlistment and a fine if still ignored. The same law also states that “the term of active duty for conscripts is two years.” It further notes that men aged 17–18 may enlist voluntarily if the army needs them. Non‑commissioned officers who serve 12 years or meet other criteria are offered civilian jobs by local governments upon discharge; those serving 30 years or reaching age 55 may retire. The Recruitment Regulations emphasize giving priority to university graduates and candidates with specific physical or professional qualifications; full‑time students and recent graduates may enlist either at their hometown or campus location."]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Original sources"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":["国务院办公厅、中央军委办公厅 (2025). 兵役登记工作规定（国办发〔2025〕41 号）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202512/content_7051363.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202512/content_7051363.htm"]},"；全国人大常委会 (2021). 兵役法（2021 年修订，第二十、二十五、二十六、五十四、五十七条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.mod.gov.cn/regulatory/2021-08/20/content_4892491.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.mod.gov.cn/regulatory/2021-08/20/content_4892491.htm"]},"（国防部刊登）；国务院、中央军委 (2023). 征兵工作条例（国务院、中央军委令第 759 号，第五条）. ",{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2023/content_5753313.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer"},"children":["http://www.gov.cn/gongbao/content/2023/content_5753313.htm"]}]},{"tag":"a","props":{"href":"https://www.gov.cn/zhengce/zhengceku/202512/content_7051363.htm","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","className":"life-source-link"},"children":["Open source link"," ",{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"13","height":"13","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"currentColor","strokeWidth":"2","strokeLinecap":"round","strokeLinejoin":"round","className":"lucide lucide-external-link","aria-hidden":"true"},"children":[{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M15 3h6v6"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M10 14 21 3"},"children":[]},{"tag":"path","props":{"d":"M18 13v6a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V8a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h6"},"children":[]}]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["Book note"]},{"tag":"p","props":{"className":"life-citations"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-content-reference"},"children":["Registration and actual enlistment are separate processes with vastly different obligations. The restriction on leaving the country for two years applies only to those who enlist and later attempt to withdraw, as detailed in item 3 (refusal to serve). Women are not required to register initially, though they may be recruited if needed. Requirements for soldiers seeking officer training or promotion are defined in internal military regulations and are not disclosed here. The Military Service Law merely states that officers are drawn from “outstanding active‑duty soldiers” and that military academies may admit students regardless of age limits; exact admission scores and quotas are not provided in this guide."]}]}]},{"tag":"div","props":{"className":"life-personal-note"},"children":[{"tag":"span","props":{"className":"life-detail-label"},"children":["My note"]},{"tag":"button","props":{"type":"button"},"children":["Write a reminder for yourself…"]}]}]}]},{"tag":"nav","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager"},"children":[{"tag":"a","props":{"className":"life-tip-pager-link","href":"/en/tip/31-01"},"children":[{"tag":"svg","props":{"xmlns":"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg","width":"16","height":"16","viewBox":"0 0 24 24","fill":"none","stroke":"curren